# 统一换行符：仓库内存 LF，检出时按平台转换
* text=auto

# Go 源码始终 LF
*.go text eol=lf
go.mod text eol=lf
go.sum text eol=lf

# 脚本
*.sh text eol=lf
*.py text eol=lf

# Windows 专用
*.cmd text eol=crlf
*.bat text eol=crlf

# 二进制
*.exe binary
*.dll binary
*.png binary
*.jpg binary
*.ico binary
*.gif binary
*.zip binary

# 文档
*.md text eol=lf
